# Stock firmware drops. Never commit these: boot.img and recovery.img are
# partition-sized dumps (192 MiB and 100 MiB) and GitHub rejects any blob over
# 100 MB, so a commit containing one cannot be pushed at all. The values they
# yielded are recorded in docs/firmware.md and dts/board.dts instead.
